---
import PageHero from '../components/astro/PageHero.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/astro/SectionHeading.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Kontak — Desa Kentengsari" description="Hubungi Pemerintah Desa Kentengsari, Kecamatan Windusari, Kabupaten Magelang. Alamat kantor desa, email, dan peta lokasi." activeRoute="kontak" canonicalPath="/kontak.html">
  <main id="main-content">
    <PageHero current="Kontak" title="Hubungi Kami" description="Kami terbuka untuk pertanyaan, masukan, dan kerja sama demi kemajuan Desa Kentengsari." />
    <section class="bg-surface-soft py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto w-[min(1120px,calc(100%-2rem))]">
        <SectionHeading centered eyebrow="Kontak & Lokasi" title="Kantor Desa Kentengsari" description="Silakan datang langsung ke kantor desa pada jam pelayanan, atau hubungi kami melalui email." />
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="grid gap-4">
            <article class="flex gap-4 rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card"><div class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-kenteng-50 text-kenteng-700"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-5.1-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.9-7 11-7 11Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.6"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-extrabold text-kenteng-950">Alamat Kantor Desa</h3><p class="mt-1 leading-7 text-muted">Kantor Desa Kentengsari, Kecamatan Windusari, Kabupaten Magelang, Jawa Tengah, Indonesia.</p></div></article>
            <article class="flex gap-4 rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card"><div class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-kenteng-50 text-kenteng-700"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-extrabold text-kenteng-950">Email Resmi</h3><a class="mt-1 block break-all font-bold text-kenteng-700 hover:text-kenteng-900" href="mailto:pemdeskentengsari@gmail.com">pemdeskentengsari@gmail.com</a></div></article>
            <article class="flex gap-4 rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card"><div class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-kenteng-50 text-kenteng-700"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-extrabold text-kenteng-950">Jam Pelayanan</h3><p class="mt-1 leading-7 text-muted">Senin – Jumat, pukul 08.00 – 14.00 WIB. Di luar jam tersebut silakan hubungi melalui email.</p></div></article>
            <article class="flex gap-4 rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card"><div class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-kenteng-50 text-kenteng-700"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 6 6L16 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A17 17 0 0 1 3 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-extrabold text-kenteng-950">Layanan Aspirasi</h3><p class="mt-1 leading-7 text-muted">Sampaikan aspirasi dan pengaduan masyarakat melalui email resmi atau langsung ke kantor desa.</p></div></article>
          </div>
          <div class="map-shell min-h-[430px] overflow-hidden rounded-panel border border-line bg-white shadow-card" data-map-shell data-map-state="loading">
            <div class="map-shell__placeholder" data-map-placeholder role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
              <span class="map-shell__pin" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                  <path d="M12 21s-7-5.1-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.9-7 11-7 11Z" />
                  <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.6" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="map-shell__label">Memuat peta lokasi…</span>
              <span class="map-shell__hint">Desa Kentengsari, Windusari</span>
            </div>
            <iframe class="map-shell__frame h-full min-h-[430px] w-full" data-map-frame src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Kentengsari,%20Windusari,%20Magelang&t=&z=14&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" title="Peta lokasi Desa Kentengsari, Windusari, Magelang" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            <noscript>
              <style>
                [data-map-placeholder] { display: none !important; }
                [data-map-frame] { opacity: 1 !important; }
              </style>
            </noscript>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <SectionHeading eyebrow="Kirim Pesan" title="Sampaikan Aspirasi & Pertanyaan Anda" />
            <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-muted">Gunakan formulir di samping untuk mengirim pesan kepada Pemerintah Desa Kentengsari. Pesan Anda akan diteruskan ke email resmi desa melalui aplikasi email di perangkat Anda.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-muted">Untuk urusan mendesak terkait pelayanan administrasi, kami sarankan datang langsung ke kantor desa pada jam pelayanan.</p>
          </div>
          <form class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white p-7 shadow-raised md:p-9" id="contactForm" action="mailto:pemdeskentengsari@gmail.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-kenteng-950">Formulir Kontak</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Lengkapi data berikut, lalu klik tombol kirim.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 grid gap-2"><label class="font-bold text-kenteng-950" for="nama">Nama Lengkap</label><input class="min-h-12 rounded-lg border border-line px-4 focus:border-kenteng-600" type="text" id="nama" name="nama" placeholder="Tulis nama Anda" required autocomplete="name" /></div>
            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-2"><label class="font-bold text-kenteng-950" for="email">Alamat Email</label><input class="min-h-12 rounded-lg border border-line px-4 focus:border-kenteng-600" type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="nama@email.com" required autocomplete="email" /></div>
            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-2"><label class="font-bold text-kenteng-950" for="pesan">Pesan</label><textarea class="min-h-36 rounded-lg border border-line p-4 focus:border-kenteng-600" id="pesan" name="pesan" placeholder="Tulis pertanyaan, aspirasi, atau masukan Anda..." required></textarea></div>
            <button class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-kenteng-700 px-6 py-3 font-extrabold text-white hover:bg-kenteng-800" type="submit">Kirim Pesan<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z"/><path d="M22 2 11 13"/></svg></button>
            <p id="formNote" class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold text-kenteng-700" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const mapShell = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-map-shell]');
    const mapFrame = mapShell?.querySelector<HTMLIFrameElement>('[data-map-frame]');
    const mapPlaceholder = mapShell?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-map-placeholder]');

    if (mapShell && mapFrame) {
      const setMapReady = () => {
        mapShell.dataset.mapState = 'ready';
        mapPlaceholder?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      };

      mapFrame.addEventListener('load', setMapReady, { once: true });
      mapShell.dataset.mapEnhanced = 'true';
    }

    const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#contactForm');
    form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!form.reportValidity()) return;
      const formData = new FormData(form);
      const nama = String(formData.get('nama') ?? '').trim();
      const email = String(formData.get('email') ?? '').trim();
      const pesan = String(formData.get('pesan') ?? '').trim();
      const subject = encodeURIComponent(`Pesan dari ${nama} — Website Desa Kentengsari`);
      const body = encodeURIComponent(`Nama: ${nama}\nEmail: ${email}\n\nPesan:\n${pesan}`);
      window.location.href = `mailto:pemdeskentengsari@gmail.com?subject=${subject}&body=${body}`;
      const note = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#formNote');
      if (note) note.textContent = 'Aplikasi email Anda akan terbuka dengan pesan yang sudah terisi. Terima kasih!';
    });
  </script>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .map-shell {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    background: #eef7f0;
  }

  .map-shell__placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    display: grid;
    place-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #175233;
    text-align: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 38%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.88), transparent 32%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #f6faf7, #e3f0e7);
    transition: opacity 240ms ease, visibility 240ms ease;
  }

  .map-shell__placeholder::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    content: '';
    background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 35%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.52) 50%, transparent 65%);
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    animation: map-shell-shimmer 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .map-shell__pin {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    place-items: center;
    color: #1e6b3f;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #d9eddf;
    border-radius: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgb(18 63 38 / 0.12);
  }

  .map-shell__label,
  .map-shell__hint {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .map-shell__label {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .map-shell__hint {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: #5f6b76;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .map-shell__frame {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: block;
    border: 0;
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 240ms ease;
  }

  .map-shell[data-map-enhanced='true'][data-map-state='loading'] .map-shell__frame {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .map-shell[data-map-state='ready'] .map-shell__placeholder {
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  @keyframes map-shell-shimmer {
    55%,
    100% {
      transform: translateX(100%);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .map-shell__placeholder,
    .map-shell__frame {
      transition: none;
    }

    .map-shell__placeholder::after {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
